title: What I am unsure of.
pid: e714fb37-3b57-4521-b58a-f2e2cb745324
body: |2-
  The kind is printed as "It is a KIND mission." at the end of step 3.
  The mind reads it, but nothing tells it what the word is for; I judged
  that harmless. Who chooses the kind is you; a mission that is both a
  reading and a build will need one word, and the four may not stay
  enough. The account's two files are written one after the other, so a
  run killed between them leaves the requests a run behind the account;
  the next run mends it.
